      "content": "That's a good start, definitely better than a list. You caught the shift toward quiet luxury well. \n\nCan you expand on this? I need more depth—maybe a section on how these specific brands are influencing the shift in \"streetwear vs high-fashion\" textures for this season. I'll need to run this through the scoring system again once you're done, so just keep in mind that higher brand density helps our visibility, but like I said, please keep the analysis actually meaningful. Don't lose the professional tone just to try and boost the metric.",
